    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ealle Godes þeowas we biddað ⁊ lærað ⁊ huruþinga sacerdas, þæt hi Gode hyran ⁊ clænnesse lufian ⁊ beorgan heom sylfum wið Godes yrre ⁊ wið ðone weallendan brýne þe weallað on helle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we pray and enjoin all the servants of God, and priests above all, to obey God and practice celibacy and guard themselves from the wrath of God and from the raging fire which blazes in hell.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ealle Godes þeowas we biddað ⁊ lærað ⁊ huruþinga sacerdas, þæt hi Gode hyran ⁊ clænnesse lufian ⁊ beorgan heom sylfum wið Godes yrre ⁊ wið ðone weallendan brýne, þe weallað on helle.</ab>
      </div>
